   205	all price in: access, fatigue, money, standing, time. Check: any use of Path
   206	ability in a scene must name or show its cost at least once per chapter per
   207	ability (breath, strain, depletion, attention budget — the drafted books'
   208	existing vocabulary).
   209	
   210	**6.3 — Foreshadow-then-pay-off.** No reveal without at least two prior plants.
   211	This series already runs this discipline as LOCKED canon: `CANON_RULES.md`
   212	§Planting Requirements sets minimum plant counts per reveal book, tracked in
   213	each book's `## Clue / Plant Ledger`. The charter reinforces it at scene level:
   214	a drafting model may not land *any* surprise — twist, betrayal, ability, or
